  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large cazuela over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced chorizo and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the paella rice and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken broth, sea salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the shredded manchego cheese until melted and well combined.",
    "Serve the paella hot, straight from the cazuela."
  ],
